      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. it looks okay, but i'm worried the coverage score might still be a bit low for the top-tier firms. looking at the list, i think a few terms didn't land quite as strongly as they could. \n\ncan you try one more version that pushes the coverage score even higher? i really want to make sure we hit every single one of those terms. again, please don't just make it a list or weirdly pad the end—just try to weave them in more thoroughly so the ATS sees a 100% match. it needs to stay professional though.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
